Farmer: You helped our merchant with the basket deliveries? Dakal a salamat!
You: We're looking for the second Mystic Ylang-Ylang. Have you heard about it?
Farmer: I saw a strange glow near the old ruins, and now our well is running dry.
Farmer: Before I can show you the records, my fields need more seedlings.
You: I can help plant them.
Farmer: First, look at the teaching garden beside me. Apat means four, lima means five, and anam means six.
Farmer: Watch the seedlings grow in the soil. Walk to the garden and press E to count the next group. Press R to go back.
Farmer: Each field has nine planting spots. Choose any of the nine fields first, then plant the correct number.
Farmer: Use E to plant, R to remove, and F to check. If you're unsure, come back to the teaching garden.
[end_timeline]
